# Line endings are LF everywhere, on every OS. The gates are bash scripts, artifacts are
# compared byte-for-byte (artifacts:fresh) and raw inputs are sha256-pinned, so a CRLF
# checkout on Windows breaks all three. See decision.md D-020.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.nc binary
*.h5 binary
*.png binary
*.bundle binary
